<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts RTZ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts RTZ.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining group RTZ-CRA Plc was rated &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs as it started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was up 6-1/2p at 928-1/2 by 1135 GMT. The company announces 1996 results next Thursday with analysts expecting profits in a range between $1.06 billion stg and $1.14 billion.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +4 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
